OL,3,AMet 'reset' means fewer police at major
OL,4,Aevents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe commissioner asked the Assembly for
OL,7,F"support" in making the changes, which
OL,8,Fhe said were due to "financial
OL,9,Fpressures".
